# Docker only honours a .dockerignore at the ROOT of the build context, so
# apps/api/.dockerignore was never being applied. Without this, `COPY apps/api
# ./apps/api` copies the host's node_modules over the ones just installed in the
# image, which on a macOS host means darwin binaries in a linux image.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.git
.next
**/.next
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.turbo
**/.turbo
